        {
          "id": "b132cbdd-7103-4ed6-b43d-54e06543c27a",
          "textContent": "<p>Uma pessoa pergunta pelo seu dia.</p><p><strong>¿Qué has hecho hoy?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
